{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "143383",
  "name": "Grand Star Hotel Bosphorus",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "1178762"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Grand Star Hotel Bosphorus \u0026 Spa, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Istanbul, steps from Istiklal Avenue and 4 minutes by foot from Taksim Square.  This hotel is 0.6 mi (0.9 km) from Bosphorus and 0.6 mi (1 km) from Galataport."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 118 air-conditioned rooms featuring minibars and flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming is available for your entertainment. Bathrooms feature showers, hair dryers, and slippers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Pamper yourself with onsite massages or enjoy recreation amenities such as a sauna. This hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and gift shops/newsstands."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EIstiklal Avenue - 0.1 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Gezi Park - 0.2 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Square - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bosphorus - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Vodafone Park - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galataport - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Acibadem Taksim Hospital - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Congress Center - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pera Palace Hotel - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lutfi Kirdar Convention and Exhibition Centre - 1.6 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Museum of Modern Art - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galata Tower - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Cruise Ship Terminal - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galata Bridge - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 41.6 km / 25.8 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Airport (IST) - 39.4 km / 24.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Grand Star Hotel Bosphorus \u0026 Spa is Istanbul Airport (IST). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuests must contact this property in advance to reserve high chair\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, a first aid kit, and window guards\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EReservations are required for massage services and spa treatments. Reservations can be made by contacting the hotel prior to arrival, using the contact information on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EOne child 5 years old or younger stays free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EThe property has connecting/adjoining rooms, which are subject to availability and can be requested by contacting the property using the number on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in and contactless check-out are available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Grab a bite at AQUA, one of the hotel\u0027s 2 restaurants, or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Snacks are also available at the coffee shop/cafe. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:30 AM to 10:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
